**Each 3x3 region centered on a pattern cell converts its background cells to 3. Background cells that don't fall into any such 3x3 region stay unchanged.**

Pattern cells (the less frequent color) never change. Background cells (most frequent) become 3 if they're within a 3x3 region centered on a pattern cell, otherwise they stay as the original background color.

